    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if the story is just... over? i'm tired of trying to find meaning in the cracks. sometimes i think it would be easier to just stop trying to fix it all. to just let it be finished. it feels like there's no point in even trying to be \"whole\" anymore.",
