      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes sense that you’re tired—fighting for wholeness when you feel shattered is exhausting. But “finished” isn’t the same as “at peace”; it’s just the point where the pain stops. You don’t have to be whole to be worthy, and you don’t have to fix everything to deserve rest. You’ve already survived every hard day so far—that’s not nothing, even if it doesn’t feel like enough right now.",
